WEBVTT

00:01:20.810 --> 00:01:21.710
Mother!

00:01:53.170 --> 00:01:55.700
Go to Tokyo, Kamui.

00:01:56.640 --> 00:01:58.770
Your destiny awaits.

00:02:31.080 --> 00:02:33.600
Mother!

00:03:07.750 --> 00:03:08.870
Where am I?

00:03:11.190 --> 00:03:12.150
Where...

00:03:13.150 --> 00:03:14.520
am I?

00:03:43.350 --> 00:03:45.650
That's... the Earth?

00:04:07.510 --> 00:04:08.810
Kamui.

00:04:13.610 --> 00:04:16.240
Two Kamuis?

00:05:10.940 --> 00:05:15.740
I've come back to Tokyo, Mother.

00:05:28.120 --> 00:05:29.820
Kamui has returned.

00:06:45.830 --> 00:06:47.130
So it seems.

00:06:47.230 --> 00:06:51.400
For the final battle to decide
the fate of this planet.

00:07:07.920 --> 00:07:10.190
Ah, what an impressive shield.

00:07:10.290 --> 00:07:12.690
Of course, I'd expect nothing less
from the master of the Kimeragi Clan.

00:07:12.790 --> 00:07:16.250
Wouldn't want to endanger
innocent bystanders, would we?

00:07:16.360 --> 00:07:19.990
After all, you're the only one
I wish to kill.

00:07:54.440 --> 00:07:58.170
You're a "Dragon of the Heavens."
I'm a "Dragon of the Earth."

00:07:58.840 --> 00:08:03.140
It has been preordained that
we fight each other to the end.

00:08:49.990 --> 00:08:51.290
Haah-taah!

00:10:30.290 --> 00:10:31.420
<i>[Telepathy]
Kamui.</i>

00:10:34.490 --> 00:10:38.120
<i>It's begun at last...
the final battle.</i>

00:10:44.670 --> 00:10:48.610
I had a dream last night,
a dream about Kamui.

00:10:48.710 --> 00:10:53.010
I haven't seen him for six years, so
how would I know how he looks now, right?

00:10:53.110 --> 00:10:57.410
But there he was in my dream,
all grown up.

00:10:57.620 --> 00:11:02.920
What's more, there were two of him.
What a strange dream.

00:11:03.020 --> 00:11:06.650
Are you listening to me, Fuma?

00:11:07.360 --> 00:11:09.920
Huh? What was that?

00:11:10.130 --> 00:11:12.500
What's wrong?
Is something bothering you?

00:11:13.270 --> 00:11:14.890
No. It's nothing.

00:11:18.040 --> 00:11:22.000
It's late. I'll go turn
the lights off in the shrine.

00:11:23.780 --> 00:11:25.070
I'll help you.

00:11:44.060 --> 00:11:45.460
It's been six years.

00:11:45.570 --> 00:11:46.190
What?

00:11:46.930 --> 00:11:49.230
Since Kamui went away.

00:11:50.200 --> 00:11:51.730
Ready?

00:11:52.140 --> 00:11:53.660
Not yet!

00:12:19.070 --> 00:12:22.160
Are you all right?

00:12:22.270 --> 00:12:23.070
I'm fine.

00:13:22.030 --> 00:13:23.890
What is it, Satsuki?

00:13:31.810 --> 00:13:33.500
Well? Is he "Kamui?"

00:13:35.310 --> 00:13:39.400
According to my computer,
he is the one.

00:13:41.520 --> 00:13:46.480
Then, it's starting at last...
the final battle.

00:14:01.740 --> 00:14:02.700
Kamui?

00:14:16.380 --> 00:14:18.250
Kamui, it's you, isn't it?

00:14:31.230 --> 00:14:32.260
Kamui.

00:16:10.830 --> 00:16:11.800
<i>[Telepathy]
Kamui.</i>

00:16:15.400 --> 00:16:17.730
How do you know my name?

00:16:18.770 --> 00:16:21.900
<i>"Kamui" is the name given
to the "Promised One."</i>

00:16:22.010 --> 00:16:24.600
<i>The one who will determine
the fate of the Earth.</i>

00:16:24.710 --> 00:16:27.200
The fate... of the Earth?

00:16:28.520 --> 00:16:32.470
<i>Please. Save our Earth.</i>

00:17:14.560 --> 00:17:16.530
Where... Where is this?

00:17:17.360 --> 00:17:18.730
<i>This is Tokyo.</i>

00:17:19.830 --> 00:17:20.860
Tokyo?

00:17:22.570 --> 00:17:25.540
This city in ruins is Tokyo?

00:17:33.750 --> 00:17:34.610
What?

00:17:36.520 --> 00:17:38.140
<i>This is all a dream.</i>

00:17:39.320 --> 00:17:39.940
A dream?

00:17:40.550 --> 00:17:44.180
<i>We are now traveling
through a dream.</i>

00:17:44.290 --> 00:17:47.950
<i>We can watch, but we cannot
change what happens in a dream.</i>

00:17:50.600 --> 00:17:55.500
<i>I am Hinoto, the "Dream Watcher."
My dreams forecast the future.</i>

00:17:55.770 --> 00:17:56.860
Dream Watcher?

00:17:56.970 --> 00:18:02.340
<i>My role is to tell others about
the future I see in my dreams.</i>

00:18:06.310 --> 00:18:09.480
Are you trying to tell me that
this is the future of Tokyo?

00:18:09.920 --> 00:18:14.440
<i>You can prevent this from happening.
You can save the Earth.</i>

00:18:15.060 --> 00:18:16.960
Save the Earth?

00:18:25.600 --> 00:18:26.760
Tokyo...

00:18:27.530 --> 00:18:28.970
as I know it.

00:20:28.350 --> 00:20:31.120
What was that? That dragon?

00:20:31.460 --> 00:20:34.430
<i>You've just seen
the "Dragons of the Earth."</i>

00:20:38.970 --> 00:20:41.430
<i>The Seven Dragons will awaken...</i>

00:20:43.340 --> 00:20:50.500
<i>to destroy Tokyo,
to destroy the Earth.</i>

00:20:57.750 --> 00:21:00.740
<i>The only force that can fight
the Dragon of the Earth...</i>

00:21:00.850 --> 00:21:03.520
<i>and save this planet
is the Dragon of the Heavens.</i>

00:21:03.760 --> 00:21:04.980
The Big Dipper?

00:21:05.760 --> 00:21:07.850
<i>The seven stars of the Big Dipper...</i>

00:21:07.960 --> 00:21:10.950
<i>The seven who can create
power shields to protect the Earth.</i>

00:21:34.720 --> 00:21:38.420
<i>Do you know the true meaning of
your name Kamui?</i>

00:21:38.530 --> 00:21:42.890
It's the name my mother gave me.
I don't care about its meaning.

00:21:43.000 --> 00:21:44.660
<i>It means "God's power."</i>

00:21:44.760 --> 00:21:47.490
<i>It is the name given to the one
who will act on behalf of God.</i>

00:21:48.170 --> 00:21:52.260
"God's power?"

00:21:52.370 --> 00:21:55.240
I don't know anything
about God's power.

00:21:55.340 --> 00:21:58.370
And the future of the Earth
is none of my concern.

00:21:58.480 --> 00:21:59.450
<i>Kamui...</i>

00:21:59.610 --> 00:22:03.510
I've come back to Tokyo for my
own reasons. Not for anyone else's.

00:22:04.020 --> 00:22:05.540
<i>But soon that Tokyo will</i> be...

00:22:05.920 --> 00:22:07.610
I don't care about Tokyo!

00:22:08.790 --> 00:22:11.450
There are others that
I need to protect!

00:22:11.560 --> 00:22:13.190
<i>Kamui, wait!</i>

00:22:16.500 --> 00:22:24.130
<i>Please. Save the Earth!
Please, Kamui!</i>

00:22:28.680 --> 00:22:31.270
Fuma! Fuma!

00:22:37.350 --> 00:22:40.680
- Are you all right?
- Yeah.

00:22:48.160 --> 00:22:49.190
Princess Hinoto!

00:22:51.800 --> 00:22:53.700
Are you all right, Princess?

00:22:53.800 --> 00:22:54.700
Hinoto.

00:22:56.070 --> 00:22:57.060
Kamui...

00:22:57.170 --> 00:22:59.470
So, that boy is Kamui.

00:23:17.690 --> 00:23:18.660
You're...

00:23:20.490 --> 00:23:22.720
Kamui, aren't you?

00:23:25.030 --> 00:23:25.930
Yes.

00:23:29.000 --> 00:23:30.230
Kamui!

00:23:30.870 --> 00:23:33.130
I'm so happy to see you!

00:23:34.910 --> 00:23:35.870
Are you okay?

00:23:36.380 --> 00:23:38.170
Yes!

00:23:41.080 --> 00:23:42.140
Welcome back.

00:23:44.820 --> 00:23:47.220
So, there really is a "Kamui."

00:23:48.420 --> 00:23:51.080
It's sort of hard to believe that
anyone could hold...

00:23:51.190 --> 00:23:54.590
the fate of the world
in his hands.

00:23:55.230 --> 00:24:00.190
I know. I always thought that
"Kamui" was something more abstract.

00:24:01.070 --> 00:24:04.900
Like a huge power without a form?

00:24:05.040 --> 00:24:05.800
<i>[Telepathy]
No!</i>

00:24:06.970 --> 00:24:08.300
<i>He is Kamui.</i>

00:24:09.240 --> 00:24:13.510
<i>Only man can decide
the fate of mankind.</i>

00:24:14.180 --> 00:24:17.710
- My mother... died.
- No!

00:24:20.190 --> 00:24:24.120
Well, now, all seven
Dragons of Heavens are here.

00:24:25.490 --> 00:24:27.720
- There's one missing.
- Huh?

00:24:28.390 --> 00:24:31.060
<i>We have lost Subaru,
the leader of the Kimeragi Clan.</i>

00:24:31.160 --> 00:24:34.160
<i>He died fighting
a Dragon of the Earth sorcerer.</i>

00:24:34.270 --> 00:24:35.230
What? Then...

00:24:35.970 --> 00:24:39.460
<i>One of the shields to protect Tokyo
has been destroyed.</i>

00:24:41.210 --> 00:24:43.870
<i>Sorata Arisugawa of
the Holy Koya Mountain.</i>

00:24:43.980 --> 00:24:47.000
<i>Arashi Kishi of the Ise Shrine.</i>

00:24:47.380 --> 00:24:49.440
<i>Yuzuriha Nekoi of
the Mitsumine Shrine.</i>

00:24:50.180 --> 00:24:51.410
<i>Karen Kasumi.</i>

00:24:51.950 --> 00:24:53.250
<i>And Seiichiro Aoki.</i>

00:24:55.020 --> 00:24:59.120
<i>Hurry, we must not let
the Dragon of the Earth get Kamui!</i>

00:25:06.230 --> 00:25:08.130
<i>It's starting...</i>

00:25:10.140 --> 00:25:13.940
<i>The bitter war to decide
the future of our planet.</i>

00:25:15.480 --> 00:25:16.440
Promise?

00:25:16.580 --> 00:25:21.210
You remember,
on the day that you left...

00:25:21.880 --> 00:25:26.510
you promised us you'd come
here one day to protect Kotori.

00:25:42.070 --> 00:25:46.630
So I promised that
if you protected Kotori...

00:25:46.870 --> 00:25:49.100
I would protect you.

00:25:50.080 --> 00:25:55.710
You've come back to Tokyo.
Now it's my turn to keep a promise.

00:25:57.050 --> 00:26:00.180
I'll protect you, Kamui!

00:26:08.530 --> 00:26:10.660
The end of the world is approaching.

00:26:10.760 --> 00:26:13.130
The end of the world?

00:26:13.330 --> 00:26:17.790
Is there something you wish
to protect with your life?

00:26:18.240 --> 00:26:21.730
Is there someone you want
to protect with your life?

00:26:21.840 --> 00:26:24.140
Kotori and Fuma.

00:26:25.650 --> 00:26:26.540
Ah.

00:26:26.650 --> 00:26:30.100
And you, Mother.
I'll protect you. I promise.

00:26:30.520 --> 00:26:35.650
Thanks, Kamui. But I'm going
to die soon. It's my destiny.

00:26:36.920 --> 00:26:37.890
Destiny?

00:26:38.860 --> 00:26:41.550
The preordained future.

00:26:41.660 --> 00:26:44.220
No! How can the future
be decided already?

00:26:44.330 --> 00:26:46.200
We can determine our own future!

00:26:46.300 --> 00:26:47.660
No, dear.

00:26:50.300 --> 00:26:52.930
Only the strong can
change their futures.

00:26:53.940 --> 00:26:59.070
Be strong, Kamui. So that
you can protect Kotori and Fuma.

00:27:01.050 --> 00:27:06.010
<i>So that you can protect
those you love with your power.</i>

00:27:07.720 --> 00:27:08.810
Rain?

00:27:10.360 --> 00:27:11.380
Ouch!

00:27:40.520 --> 00:27:42.540
Fuma! Take Kotori.

00:27:46.060 --> 00:27:47.420
My name is Nataku.

00:27:48.060 --> 00:27:49.960
Is this rain your doing?

00:27:50.930 --> 00:27:51.900
It's mine!

00:27:59.410 --> 00:28:00.300
You!

00:28:00.410 --> 00:28:02.700
I'm Shougo Asagi.

00:28:22.660 --> 00:28:26.530
Please come with us.
I've been ordered to escort you.

00:28:26.630 --> 00:28:27.930
Yeah? Where to?

00:28:28.370 --> 00:28:30.930
You'll know when you get there.

00:28:32.070 --> 00:28:33.700
And if I refuse?

00:28:43.280 --> 00:28:44.150
Kamui!

00:28:45.020 --> 00:28:48.250
My job is to take you back with us.

00:28:50.360 --> 00:28:51.320
No!

00:28:54.530 --> 00:28:56.390
I didn't think it'd be easy.

00:29:45.240 --> 00:29:49.680
Not bad, Kamui.
But then, I was just warming up.

00:29:50.780 --> 00:29:54.010
I don't want to hurt you...

00:29:54.150 --> 00:29:55.480
but you leave me no choice.

00:29:55.860 --> 00:30:00.760
Hey, wait a minute!
Two against one? That's not fair.

00:30:06.400 --> 00:30:08.490
Don't be mean to Kamui!

00:30:10.400 --> 00:30:12.340
If you like two against one...

00:30:12.940 --> 00:30:15.570
I bet you'll love
two against five!

00:30:19.280 --> 00:30:22.580
Well. Now we can fight
fair and square.

00:30:23.780 --> 00:30:25.440
Um, I don't quite agree.

00:30:25.550 --> 00:30:29.180
Oh, you'll understand
when you grow up.

00:30:29.290 --> 00:30:33.160
No, I'm a grown up,
but I don't agree, either.

00:30:37.400 --> 00:30:38.590
Hey, Sorata.

00:30:39.700 --> 00:30:43.630
We wouldn't want to disturb
the nice people of the neighborhood.

00:30:44.400 --> 00:30:46.700
I know, I know.

00:30:47.570 --> 00:30:50.410
You're always thinking
one step ahead of me, babe.

00:30:51.010 --> 00:30:51.910
"Babe"?

00:31:32.720 --> 00:31:36.090
Don't you think
you're overdoing it a bit?

00:31:36.190 --> 00:31:40.520
Sure, the shield will thrust the area
inside it into another dimension.

00:31:41.790 --> 00:31:44.190
And no amount of damage
which occurs within the shield...

00:31:44.300 --> 00:31:45.560
will have any effect
on the real world.

00:31:47.630 --> 00:31:52.940
But once its creator dies,
the shield loses its power.

00:31:53.040 --> 00:31:57.300
And all destruction inside the shield
suddenly becomes very real!

00:31:57.980 --> 00:31:59.210
So, you've done your homework.

00:31:59.310 --> 00:32:03.150
I've seen it happen. The death
of a Dragon of the Heavens...

00:32:03.250 --> 00:32:05.810
and the crumbling of the shield!

00:32:29.740 --> 00:32:31.680
What a cute gimmick he's got there.

00:32:31.780 --> 00:32:34.250
Almost as good as yours, Karen.

00:32:47.060 --> 00:32:49.690
Whoa! Whoa! Whoa!

00:32:52.030 --> 00:32:54.000
Thanks, Inuki.

00:32:59.610 --> 00:33:03.230
Listen, buddy, we're here
to see Kamui, too.

00:33:03.340 --> 00:33:05.400
Why don't you
just go home for today?

00:33:13.550 --> 00:33:14.850
Oops!

00:33:19.190 --> 00:33:20.720
Fuma...

00:33:23.930 --> 00:33:26.260
Oh! Makeishibaraya! Sowaka!

00:33:29.870 --> 00:33:30.770
Hah!

00:33:37.480 --> 00:33:40.240
Sorry about the weather.

00:33:45.180 --> 00:33:46.310
Fuma.

00:33:52.420 --> 00:33:53.720
Kotori!

00:33:59.060 --> 00:34:00.760
Fuma! Kotori!

00:34:12.280 --> 00:34:15.300
What have you done
with Fuma and Kotori?

00:34:15.410 --> 00:34:17.510
No. You've got it all wrong!

00:34:18.950 --> 00:34:20.420
Listen.

00:34:21.220 --> 00:34:22.310
Bring them back!

00:34:27.630 --> 00:34:29.360
Whoa!

00:34:36.400 --> 00:34:37.960
You okay?

00:34:38.070 --> 00:34:40.870
Yeah. I'll live.

00:34:41.070 --> 00:34:44.300
What happened to the guys
with their magic tricks?

00:34:44.410 --> 00:34:48.070
They took off. Probably thought you
were too much for them to handle.

00:34:49.780 --> 00:34:52.080
How smart of them!
Ouch...

00:34:53.650 --> 00:34:54.580
But...

00:34:55.150 --> 00:34:57.180
That's some power he's got.

00:34:57.290 --> 00:34:59.590
Like the name says,
it's "God's power."

00:35:01.330 --> 00:35:02.290
Wait!

00:35:07.400 --> 00:35:11.130
We've played no part
in the abduction of your friends.

00:35:17.080 --> 00:35:20.710
It is probably the work
of the Dragon of the Earth.

00:35:24.850 --> 00:35:29.120
Please come with us, Kamui.

00:35:42.770 --> 00:35:47.230
Come to me, pretty lady.

00:35:59.950 --> 00:36:02.390
Kamui's loved one.

00:36:02.490 --> 00:36:07.150
You're a pretty flower
to lure Kamui into my grasp.

00:36:52.340 --> 00:36:57.930
But how... how did you
come uninvited into my dream?

00:37:06.150 --> 00:37:07.710
Where is Kotori?

00:37:10.390 --> 00:37:12.690
Where have you taken her?

00:37:18.300 --> 00:37:20.790
Did you hear what I said?

00:37:20.900 --> 00:37:25.360
Where is she?
What have you done with her?

00:37:25.470 --> 00:37:28.630
I've found him, the other Kamui.

00:37:29.610 --> 00:37:31.470
Kamui's twin star.
The "other" to complement Kamui.

00:37:32.280 --> 00:37:37.650
No matter which dragon
Kamui should become...

00:37:37.750 --> 00:37:40.380
this "other" will fill his place.

00:38:45.050 --> 00:38:52.080
Tokyo. This is... Tokyo.
But what am I doing here?

00:38:52.190 --> 00:38:56.060
A minute ago, I was standing
in Togakushi Shrine, and now...

00:38:56.160 --> 00:38:57.220
This is a dream.

00:38:57.330 --> 00:38:57.950
A dream?

00:38:58.430 --> 00:39:00.300
Yes, a dream.

00:39:00.400 --> 00:39:04.730
It's no ordinary dream.
This dream shows the future.

00:39:05.070 --> 00:39:07.000
The future?

00:39:07.110 --> 00:39:11.340
I am Kanoe, the Dream Watcher.
My dreams reflect the future.

00:39:11.710 --> 00:39:13.200
Dream Watcher?

00:39:13.310 --> 00:39:19.250
My role is to tell others about
the future I see in my dreams.

00:39:19.350 --> 00:39:21.820
We are now traveling
through that dream.

00:39:22.820 --> 00:39:24.880
This is Tokyo of the future?

00:39:24.990 --> 00:39:29.480
Yes. Tokyo is now stagnant and foul.
This is how it will look...

00:39:29.600 --> 00:39:33.860
in the future, once everything
has been cleansed and revived.

00:39:35.230 --> 00:39:40.360
But why is the Tokyo Metropolitan
Government Building still standing?

00:39:57.190 --> 00:40:01.290
Don't worry.
That dragon is one of us.

00:40:01.390 --> 00:40:04.120
Why, it may even be you!

00:40:05.600 --> 00:40:08.500
The Dragon of the Earth will destroy
all the power shields...

00:40:08.600 --> 00:40:10.120
in Tokyo and open the gateway
to Earth's revival.

00:40:11.040 --> 00:40:12.730
Dragon of the Earth?

00:40:31.960 --> 00:40:35.790
Tokyo's power shields are a crucial
force holding the world together.

00:40:36.730 --> 00:40:39.990
There are many shields here.

00:40:40.100 --> 00:40:43.470
The skyscrapers of Shinjuku
form a huge power stone.

00:40:43.570 --> 00:40:47.030
The rails for the Yamanote train line
run in the shape of Buddha's hand...

00:40:47.140 --> 00:40:49.330
to protect the Imperial Palace
as well as all of Tokyo.

00:40:49.440 --> 00:40:52.000
The Sunshine 60 Building
serves as a foundation...

00:40:52.110 --> 00:40:54.170
to support Tokyo's insecure ground.

00:40:54.280 --> 00:40:58.810
And there is Tokyo Tower.

00:40:59.820 --> 00:41:02.810
Destroy all of these shields,
and Tokyo will fall.

00:41:04.290 --> 00:41:07.050
The obscene structures built
by man, everything corrupt...

00:41:07.160 --> 00:41:09.990
and polluted will be annihilated.

00:41:10.100 --> 00:41:14.260
Nature will be revived, and Earth
will return to its original state.

00:41:14.370 --> 00:41:19.460
The only force that might
prevent this from happening is...

00:41:19.570 --> 00:41:21.540
the Dragon of the Heavens!

00:41:40.060 --> 00:41:44.150
You possess
the same power as Kamui.

00:41:44.260 --> 00:41:47.200
You were born
to be Kamui's twin star.

00:41:47.300 --> 00:41:50.740
No matter which dragon
Kamui chooses to become...

00:41:50.840 --> 00:41:53.360
you will join the opposing side
to take his place.

00:41:53.470 --> 00:41:55.410
You are "The Other."

00:42:09.490 --> 00:42:11.150
Kotori!

00:42:18.360 --> 00:42:20.990
- <i>Kotori!</i>
- Fuma.

00:42:30.880 --> 00:42:31.740
Kamui?

00:42:37.420 --> 00:42:40.210
Noooo!

00:42:56.100 --> 00:42:57.630
Nooo!

00:42:59.070 --> 00:43:01.630
This is just a dream!

00:43:02.740 --> 00:43:06.340
It's only a dream.

00:43:14.790 --> 00:43:21.560
Yes. It's only a dream.
But it's also the future.

00:43:31.140 --> 00:43:36.540
The Earth is dying.
If something isn't done...

00:43:36.680 --> 00:43:41.480
to prevent it, the Earth will die,
polluted and violated by man...

00:43:41.610 --> 00:43:43.840
and robbed of any power
to revive itself.

00:43:55.960 --> 00:43:59.260
Without mass destruction,
Earth can no longer revive itself.

00:44:01.430 --> 00:44:05.130
Please. You can save the Earth!

00:44:05.700 --> 00:44:10.840
I don't have this power you say
can save the Earth or destroy it.

00:44:10.980 --> 00:44:12.500
I'm just an ordinary
high school student.

00:44:12.940 --> 00:44:16.040
The power is in you.
You just don't realize it yet.

00:44:25.060 --> 00:44:28.120
Traveling through my dream was
more than that girl could endure.

00:44:29.690 --> 00:44:33.560
Don't worry. She's now
sleeping deep within my dream.

00:44:33.700 --> 00:44:35.890
Safe from Kamui.

00:44:36.700 --> 00:44:37.570
Kamui.

00:44:37.700 --> 00:44:38.930
Yes. Kamui.

00:44:39.740 --> 00:44:44.040
The name given to the one
who will hunt down the forces...

00:44:44.180 --> 00:44:46.510
that control God's power
is the Other Kamui.

00:44:46.650 --> 00:44:47.480
That is you!

00:44:47.780 --> 00:44:50.180
Please. You must join the
Dragon of the Earth.

00:44:50.320 --> 00:44:53.480
Destroy Tokyo's power shields.

00:44:53.620 --> 00:44:56.780
That is the only way
you can save your little sister.

00:44:56.920 --> 00:45:00.480
And Kamui,
I'm not going to let him...

00:45:01.790 --> 00:45:02.520
kill.

00:45:04.460 --> 00:45:10.460
That's for you to decide.

00:45:45.470 --> 00:45:46.200
Kamui!

00:46:24.080 --> 00:46:25.630
<i>[Telepathy]
I have been waiting.</i>

00:46:28.910 --> 00:46:33.870
<i>I cannot talk. I cannot hear
and I cannot see.</i>

00:46:34.520 --> 00:46:38.420
<i>Please excuse my speaking to you
through your mind.</i>

00:46:40.790 --> 00:46:41.450
Come.

00:46:48.430 --> 00:46:49.200
You again.

00:46:49.830 --> 00:46:52.830
<i>Forgive me if I had angered you
by pulling you into my dream...</i>

00:46:52.970 --> 00:46:54.940
<i>without any warning.</i>

00:46:57.180 --> 00:47:01.080
Our little Princess here
tells the future for...

00:47:01.210 --> 00:47:03.580
the guys who run this country.

00:47:04.180 --> 00:47:07.620
<i>The Final Battle
has already begun, Kamui.</i>

00:47:07.750 --> 00:47:14.590
<i>Please fight with us to save Tokyo.
To save the Earth.</i>

00:47:15.430 --> 00:47:19.160
I told you! The only reason
I've come back to Tokyo is...

00:47:19.930 --> 00:47:23.660
<i>To protect the girl and her brother
who run the Togakushi Shrine.</i>

00:47:26.540 --> 00:47:28.170
Why do you say that?

00:47:28.740 --> 00:47:31.940
<i>When we travelled through my dream,
I saw them.</i>

00:47:32.080 --> 00:47:34.740
<i>The people whom you care for...</i>

00:47:35.480 --> 00:47:39.210
- <i>The two you love more than anyone.</i>
- No, Kamui!

00:47:39.580 --> 00:47:41.210
Shut up!

00:47:46.320 --> 00:47:50.690
- You took Kotori and Fuma?
- <i>No.</i>

00:47:51.330 --> 00:47:53.230
Then, who did?

00:47:54.430 --> 00:47:58.390
<i>Kanoe, my younger sister.</i>

00:47:58.540 --> 00:48:00.130
Your sister?

00:48:02.440 --> 00:48:03.810
I don't understand.

00:48:03.940 --> 00:48:07.140
<i>Kanoe is my younger sister.
My only kin.</i>

00:48:08.050 --> 00:48:11.710
<i>She can travel through dreams,
as I can.</i>

00:48:12.280 --> 00:48:15.680
<i>Kanoe is gathering the forces
of the Dragon of the Earth...</i>

00:48:15.820 --> 00:48:17.450
<i>to destroy this planet.</i>

00:48:17.590 --> 00:48:22.390
The Dragon of the Earth?
The one you showed me in your dream?

00:48:28.470 --> 00:48:29.400
<i>Hold my hand.</i>

00:48:33.970 --> 00:48:36.910
<i>I will show you YOUR future.</i>

00:48:52.190 --> 00:48:55.630
Kotori!

00:50:01.490 --> 00:50:05.290
Are you saying that...
I'm going to kill Kotori?

00:50:05.960 --> 00:50:09.830
<i>You can change this future by
becoming a Dragon of the Heavens.</i>

00:50:11.340 --> 00:50:13.700
Your dreams are in bad taste.

00:50:17.580 --> 00:50:20.700
For a long time, I thought
the same way you did.

00:50:20.850 --> 00:50:22.970
The future of the Earth
was none of my concern.

00:50:23.110 --> 00:50:26.880
The story was too hard
to believe, anyway.

00:50:30.360 --> 00:50:33.550
I didn't understand why I had
this power, and I didn't want it.

00:50:33.690 --> 00:50:39.360
I started working
in bars and brothels 'cause there...

00:50:39.500 --> 00:50:41.660
nobody asks any questions.

00:50:41.800 --> 00:50:45.240
But I love this city. I really do.

00:50:45.370 --> 00:50:48.570
And I'm not going
to let anyone destroy it.

00:50:51.480 --> 00:50:56.070
My wife and daughter love Tokyo,
just as Karen does.

00:50:56.210 --> 00:51:01.810
My wish is for the three of us
to lead a simple...

00:51:01.950 --> 00:51:05.390
but peaceful life in this city.

00:51:06.520 --> 00:51:07.960
Listen, Kamui.

00:51:20.810 --> 00:51:24.400
This computer here is called the
"Beast." Satsuki created it herself.

00:51:24.540 --> 00:51:28.000
She can break into
any network and access...

00:51:28.150 --> 00:51:31.840
any kind of information she needs.

00:51:31.980 --> 00:51:37.420
According to Satsuki,
the "Beast" loves her very much.

00:51:37.560 --> 00:51:43.190
It gets very jealous when she puts
her mind on other things.

00:51:43.330 --> 00:51:47.290
I guess you can call it
a love affair between a computer...

00:51:47.430 --> 00:51:49.560
and the world's greatest cyber-girl.

00:51:52.340 --> 00:51:55.240
Are you surprised? Nobody would
dream that something like this...

00:51:55.370 --> 00:51:58.970
exists underneath the Tokyo
Government Metropolitan Building.

00:52:21.000 --> 00:52:25.830
How beautiful... a glass Tokyo.

00:52:28.440 --> 00:52:31.340
I'll prove to you
that my prophesy is true.

00:52:33.240 --> 00:52:33.870
Here.

00:52:34.010 --> 00:52:36.170
This... will fall.

00:52:38.780 --> 00:52:39.680
What's wrong, Princess Hinoto?

00:52:40.390 --> 00:52:43.680
<i>Tokyo Station...
Tokyo Station will fall!</i>

00:53:18.260 --> 00:53:20.660
Let's take a picture, guys!

00:53:21.230 --> 00:53:22.890
Take my great shot, Mom.

00:53:22.990 --> 00:53:24.150
Oh, don't worry!

00:53:24.300 --> 00:53:25.130
Hahahaha...

00:53:25.260 --> 00:53:28.360
Come on, Kotori.
Get in the picture.

00:53:29.730 --> 00:53:31.900
Cut it out, guys!

00:53:32.040 --> 00:53:33.630
Say, "cheese."

00:53:44.020 --> 00:53:46.610
Be strong, Kamui.

00:53:46.900 --> 00:53:49.530
So that you can protect
Kotori and Fuma.

00:53:49.670 --> 00:53:53.730
So that you can protect
those you love with your power.

00:53:54.470 --> 00:53:58.070
Listen, Kamui, you've got the power.

00:53:58.210 --> 00:54:01.800
You decide how
you're going to use it.

00:54:15.690 --> 00:54:17.220
Well. Shall we go?

00:54:17.360 --> 00:54:18.730
Yes.

00:54:19.300 --> 00:54:20.230
Yuzuriha.

00:54:20.360 --> 00:54:21.090
Yes, Karen?

00:54:21.230 --> 00:54:23.330
- You wait here.
- What?

00:54:23.970 --> 00:54:28.370
If anything should happen to us,
you go tell the others.

00:54:28.670 --> 00:54:30.640
I'll fight with you!

00:54:30.780 --> 00:54:34.540
They don't need me to report
what happens here.

00:54:34.680 --> 00:54:37.150
Hinoto will know.

00:54:38.550 --> 00:54:43.110
There are many other shields
that need to be protected.

00:54:43.250 --> 00:54:47.850
Please let us handle this one.

00:54:51.160 --> 00:54:55.960
Make sure you stay outside
my power shield, okay?

00:55:09.950 --> 00:55:13.380
Hey, hey, hey! Wait up!
Wait, I say!

00:55:13.520 --> 00:55:16.150
Wait for me!

00:55:16.720 --> 00:55:17.350
Hey!

00:56:27.490 --> 00:56:32.990
<i>"Karen, please make the power shield."</i>

00:57:12.740 --> 00:57:13.400
Haa!

00:57:31.220 --> 00:57:31.880
Ugh!

00:58:24.740 --> 00:58:26.400
Don't get carried away!

00:58:28.080 --> 00:58:30.550
Arrgh!

00:58:43.060 --> 00:58:43.960
Karen!

00:59:10.820 --> 00:59:15.160
<i>Kamui. Kamui.</i>

00:59:37.210 --> 00:59:38.680
<i>Kamui...</i>

00:59:42.050 --> 00:59:48.550
<i>something... is...</i>

00:59:50.130 --> 00:59:54.890
inside... me... Kamui.

00:59:55.370 --> 01:00:00.170
<i>Something... is growing...
inside me.</i>

01:00:12.350 --> 01:00:18.020
<i>It will... soon be born.</i>

01:00:20.960 --> 01:00:21.860
Kotori?

01:00:24.030 --> 01:00:25.290
Ugh!

01:00:43.710 --> 01:00:44.810
<i>No! Karen's...!</i>

01:00:44.920 --> 01:00:45.640
<i>Yes.</i>

01:00:47.180 --> 01:00:50.020
Where is Aoki?

01:00:50.150 --> 01:00:52.680
I can't find him anywhere.

01:00:53.160 --> 01:00:57.720
That means he's moved to
another shield.

01:00:59.730 --> 01:01:00.700
All right!

01:01:02.930 --> 01:01:05.200
No way!
I'm fighting with you!

01:01:05.740 --> 01:01:07.200
Uh, oh...

01:01:10.640 --> 01:01:12.200
<i>[Telepathy]
Kamui has returned.</i>

01:01:28.460 --> 01:01:30.220
<i>So. Now, you have Kamui.</i>

01:01:31.500 --> 01:01:32.150
<i>Kanoe...</i>

01:01:33.860 --> 01:01:36.700
you think you've won?

01:01:37.430 --> 01:01:40.060
Well, it happens that
I've found my own Kamui.

01:01:40.500 --> 01:01:41.160
<i>What?</i>

01:01:41.670 --> 01:01:45.040
The other Kamui... the one who
was born to join the opposing side...

01:01:45.180 --> 01:01:48.110
no matter which dragon Kamui
chose to become...

01:01:48.810 --> 01:01:50.110
<i>The Other!</i>

01:01:50.650 --> 01:01:56.180
Yes, and he's one of
your Kamui's precious friends.

01:01:56.320 --> 01:01:59.590
It's the reason
for his return to Tokyo.

01:02:00.990 --> 01:02:02.690
Sad, isn't it...

01:02:02.790 --> 01:02:06.130
that the two are destined to
fight each other to the death.

01:02:07.600 --> 01:02:08.690
<i>Kanoe, how could you...</i>

01:02:09.130 --> 01:02:11.620
How could I?
You think I'm cruel, Hinoto?

01:02:11.770 --> 01:02:14.260
I didn't wish for this.

01:02:14.410 --> 01:02:17.100
It's their destiny that's cruel.

01:02:17.640 --> 01:02:18.770
<i>Stop this, Kanoe!</i>

01:02:18.910 --> 01:02:22.140
<i>Stop the Dragon of the Earth
from destroying the power shields!</i>

01:02:22.580 --> 01:02:23.200
No!

01:02:29.150 --> 01:02:34.020
I have the right to wish for
the future of my desire.

01:02:34.160 --> 01:02:36.350
<i>The destruction of the Earth?
Is that your desire?</i>

01:02:36.490 --> 01:02:37.150
The Earth?

01:02:42.130 --> 01:02:44.230
I don't care about the Earth.

01:02:46.170 --> 01:02:47.000
<i>Kanoe!</i>

01:02:47.140 --> 01:02:50.000
The battle has just begun, Hinoto.

01:02:50.140 --> 01:02:55.640
Let's see whether
your Kamui can beat mine.

01:02:56.580 --> 01:03:00.740
This battle is meaningless!

01:03:11.430 --> 01:03:15.300
What does the Dragon of the Earth
hope to achieve?

01:03:16.170 --> 01:03:20.800
It is not the Earth we wish to
destroy. It's mankind.

01:03:21.610 --> 01:03:24.570
Men kill, they hate,
they devastate this planet.

01:03:24.710 --> 01:03:26.540
What, then, is the reason
for their existence?

01:03:30.080 --> 01:03:32.310
What the Earth needs now
is tranquility.

01:03:36.590 --> 01:03:38.050
Maybe you're right.

01:03:38.920 --> 01:03:42.450
But there are people
I need to protect!

01:03:43.490 --> 01:03:48.900
For those people, and for those
who died fighting for the Earth...

01:03:50.730 --> 01:03:53.500
I can't let you live!

01:04:23.200 --> 01:04:24.220
Aoki!

01:04:25.440 --> 01:04:28.740
How many shields
are still standing?

01:04:40.180 --> 01:04:43.850
Code 1095 from the Beast.

01:04:43.990 --> 01:04:47.750
The area within the Sunshine 60 shield
has been totally eliminated.

01:04:48.160 --> 01:04:52.390
The area within a five-kilometer
radius has been destroyed.

01:04:52.530 --> 01:04:57.760
Code 1096! Seiichiro Aoki of the
Dragon of the Heavens is dead.

01:04:57.900 --> 01:05:01.100
We have lost Nataku in the battle.

01:05:15.590 --> 01:05:17.780
What a glorious sunrise.

01:05:19.090 --> 01:05:21.490
I can't believe I said that.

01:05:24.230 --> 01:05:29.690
I am... the other Kamui?

01:05:29.830 --> 01:05:32.830
Who decided that?

01:05:32.970 --> 01:05:39.810
What about Kotori?
She's now making me a...

01:05:40.280 --> 01:05:45.720
I don't care about the Earth
or the fate of the world.

01:05:45.850 --> 01:05:50.150
I've returned to protect
those people I love...

01:05:50.290 --> 01:05:51.950
and I'll fight for them!

01:05:52.090 --> 01:05:53.920
That's the best reason
I've heard yet, Kamui!

01:06:02.300 --> 01:06:03.820
Hey, Kamui!

01:06:05.970 --> 01:06:07.600
Take care of Yuzuriha, will ya?

01:06:13.440 --> 01:06:15.100
You don't have to worry about me!

01:06:44.310 --> 01:06:45.740
Nice dog.

01:06:47.610 --> 01:06:49.080
Good boy.

01:07:00.160 --> 01:07:01.850
What is it?

01:07:01.990 --> 01:07:03.150
A Dragon of the Earth.

01:07:15.870 --> 01:07:18.470
Have I got something
on my face, kid?

01:07:21.710 --> 01:07:23.370
Wait!

01:07:24.250 --> 01:07:27.480
You can see Inuki?

01:07:27.750 --> 01:07:31.450
Inuki? Strange name.

01:07:31.960 --> 01:07:33.680
The only ones
who can see Inuki are...

01:07:33.820 --> 01:07:36.490
the people concerned
with the end of the Earth.

01:07:37.490 --> 01:07:39.220
Which means?

01:07:39.630 --> 01:07:42.220
That you must be
a Dragon of the Earth.

01:07:42.970 --> 01:07:44.260
A Dragon of the Heavens.

01:07:44.600 --> 01:07:46.230
Tell me. Where is Kotori?

01:07:46.370 --> 01:07:47.670
Hah!

01:08:09.930 --> 01:08:12.160
That's Yuzuriha's shield.

01:08:12.300 --> 01:08:14.730
It's started.

01:08:16.030 --> 01:08:19.470
Yuzuriha's just what,
14 years old now?

01:08:19.600 --> 01:08:23.130
I bet she's never
even fallen in love.

01:08:23.270 --> 01:08:27.210
Maybe we should have
left her with Hinoto.

01:08:27.340 --> 01:08:28.740
You're going soft.

01:08:30.780 --> 01:08:32.370
Let's lend them a helping hand then.

01:08:32.520 --> 01:08:33.310
"A helping hand?"

01:08:34.720 --> 01:08:35.510
That's right.

01:08:56.570 --> 01:08:59.510
Why, he's just like Kamui.

01:09:06.580 --> 01:09:08.570
- A Dragon of the Earth?
- Yes.

01:09:09.290 --> 01:09:12.520
Strange, though.

01:09:12.890 --> 01:09:15.520
Why is he so much like Kamui?

01:09:35.450 --> 01:09:41.110
Don't worry.
Whatever happens, I'll protect you.

01:09:41.250 --> 01:09:44.620
I like you, babe.
You're my type... a real knockout.

01:09:44.760 --> 01:09:47.120
I bet you say that to all the girls.

01:09:47.260 --> 01:09:48.120
That's not true!

01:09:48.260 --> 01:09:50.450
You're the one I want to protect.

01:09:51.930 --> 01:09:56.520
Having someone to protect can make
a guy strong. You just watch.

01:10:01.270 --> 01:10:01.900
Hah!

01:10:43.410 --> 01:10:46.250
Hey, Yuto! Are you going to
just stand there and watch?

01:10:49.220 --> 01:10:51.850
Sorry. Your fighting
was so impressive...

01:10:51.990 --> 01:10:54.250
I thought it'd be
a shame to interfere.

01:10:54.390 --> 01:10:56.990
Cut the crap.
This isn't a training exercise!

01:11:00.960 --> 01:11:02.490
Hah!

01:11:26.790 --> 01:11:28.020
What the...

01:11:28.690 --> 01:11:31.630
Someone is controlling
the underground cables!

01:11:31.760 --> 01:11:33.520
Wow. A work of art.

01:12:29.290 --> 01:12:30.080
Hah!

01:12:36.390 --> 01:12:40.990
Hahaha. That was close.
Caught me looking the wrong way.

01:12:45.540 --> 01:12:48.030
Hah!

01:12:51.310 --> 01:12:52.300
Noooo!

01:13:27.210 --> 01:13:28.640
<i>Hey, buddy!</i>

01:13:29.050 --> 01:13:31.780
You're Kamui's friend, aren't you?

01:13:33.780 --> 01:13:35.610
Kamui's looking for you!

01:13:36.720 --> 01:13:38.280
Kamui...

01:13:40.290 --> 01:13:42.660
Kamui... is me!

01:13:49.670 --> 01:13:50.690
Fuma.

01:13:55.810 --> 01:13:57.170
Kamui!

01:14:12.260 --> 01:14:13.720
Yuzuriha!

01:14:19.000 --> 01:14:21.160
Say goodbye, kid.

01:14:21.300 --> 01:14:22.390
Ugh!

01:14:31.140 --> 01:14:35.410
I'm sorry. I guess I didn't do
too well, did I?

01:14:36.680 --> 01:14:40.120
You know, I've never been
in love with anyone.

01:14:40.250 --> 01:14:43.910
I wish I had someone
to cry for me at my death.

01:14:54.630 --> 01:15:01.660
<i>Hey, Kamui. Promise me that
you'll protect the ones you love!</i>

01:16:54.650 --> 01:16:56.240
Fuma! You're all right?

01:16:57.250 --> 01:16:59.240
Leave this to me.

01:17:03.730 --> 01:17:04.990
Ugh!

01:17:06.930 --> 01:17:07.950
Fuma?

01:17:16.310 --> 01:17:21.970
So, you've chosen to become
a Dragon of the Heavens.

01:17:22.110 --> 01:17:24.770
I'm your twin star.

01:17:24.910 --> 01:17:29.080
If you're a Dragon of the Heavens,
then I'm a Dragon of the Earth.

01:17:29.190 --> 01:17:31.520
I was born to be your counterpart.

01:17:32.790 --> 01:17:33.520
Fuma.

01:17:34.120 --> 01:17:40.030
As a Dragon of the Earth,
I must kill you. It's my destiny.

01:17:40.760 --> 01:17:42.160
Fuma.

01:17:43.630 --> 01:17:46.930
It's destiny, Kamui.

01:17:49.840 --> 01:17:50.640
<i>[Telepathy]
Kamui!</i>

01:18:04.420 --> 01:18:06.350
<i>Kamui.</i>

01:18:07.860 --> 01:18:11.220
<i>How cruel that you must fight
the one you promised...</i>

01:18:11.460 --> 01:18:14.860
<i>to protect with your life.</i>

01:18:17.130 --> 01:18:20.830
Take me to Kotori.

01:18:25.610 --> 01:18:27.240
Take me...

01:18:27.810 --> 01:18:30.140
inside your dream.

01:18:35.320 --> 01:18:36.650
Fuma?

01:18:43.390 --> 01:18:44.290
It is time.

01:18:45.030 --> 01:18:49.160
The sword which can be created only
by those who love Kamui deeply...

01:18:50.370 --> 01:18:54.170
The first sword belongs to the Kamui
who is the Dragon of the Heavens.

01:18:56.010 --> 01:18:56.770
And...

01:18:57.670 --> 01:18:59.510
this belongs to the Kamui who is...

01:19:00.240 --> 01:19:01.840
the Dragon of the Earth.

01:19:05.680 --> 01:19:07.450
Kotori.

01:19:23.370 --> 01:19:25.700
Run, Kotori!

01:19:36.280 --> 01:19:36.900
Kamui!

01:19:39.820 --> 01:19:41.910
Kotori! This way!

01:19:48.560 --> 01:19:49.790
Kamui!

01:19:54.060 --> 01:19:54.690
Kotori!

01:20:02.870 --> 01:20:03.500
Fuma?

01:20:57.890 --> 01:20:58.920
Noooo...

01:21:06.000 --> 01:21:10.060
Kotori!

01:21:42.770 --> 01:21:44.140
Why?

01:21:46.810 --> 01:21:47.470
Ugh!

01:21:48.310 --> 01:21:49.540
Yuto!

01:21:52.320 --> 01:21:53.580
No!

01:21:53.720 --> 01:21:56.690
Beast! Help Yuto!

01:21:57.050 --> 01:21:58.150
Why?

01:21:58.290 --> 01:22:00.690
You killed Kusanagi,
and now you're going to kill me?

01:22:00.820 --> 01:22:03.190
I thought
we were on the same side...

01:22:03.630 --> 01:22:07.690
I don't remember taking sides.
And I don't need your help.

01:22:08.000 --> 01:22:11.230
Beast, didn't you hear me?
I said, help Yuto!

01:22:16.410 --> 01:22:19.500
Are you doing this for Kamui?

01:22:20.080 --> 01:22:21.630
I am Kamui!

01:22:22.380 --> 01:22:23.000
Argh!

01:22:29.450 --> 01:22:30.420
Ugh!

01:22:34.590 --> 01:22:38.120
<i>"Satsuki is our property."</i>

01:22:38.230 --> 01:22:41.490
<i>"Nobody is going to take her away."</i>

01:22:41.600 --> 01:22:44.660
<i>"Satsuki is our property..."</i>

01:22:53.280 --> 01:22:54.540
What's going on here?

01:22:54.680 --> 01:22:58.270
<i>[Telepathy]
That boy is the other Kamui.</i>

01:22:58.380 --> 01:23:01.680
<i>One who lives only
to kill and destroy.</i>

01:23:01.820 --> 01:23:06.380
<i>One whose only goal is to strike
down the Dragon of the Heavens...</i>

01:23:06.490 --> 01:23:09.750
<i>and annihilate the power shields
protecting Tokyo.</i>

01:23:28.410 --> 01:23:30.140
The Dragon of the Earth has fallen.

01:23:37.720 --> 01:23:39.150
Ugh!

01:23:39.760 --> 01:23:40.950
<i>Kanoe!</i>

01:24:15.390 --> 01:24:16.020
Hinoto...

01:24:17.390 --> 01:24:18.020
Hah!

01:24:18.130 --> 01:24:19.190
Ugh!

01:24:28.740 --> 01:24:32.770
Hinoto, you've lived here
all your life...

01:24:32.910 --> 01:24:38.510
telling the future for the men
who run the government.

01:24:38.650 --> 01:24:42.520
You predicted that,
with Kamui on your side...

01:24:42.650 --> 01:24:46.590
Tokyo's power shields
would be protected.

01:24:49.760 --> 01:24:52.020
But the Dragon of the Earth
has risen.

01:24:52.860 --> 01:24:57.770
The Dragons of the Heavens
will all be destroyed.

01:25:03.310 --> 01:25:05.770
Dragon of the Heavens,
you've got no chance against me.

01:25:06.680 --> 01:25:11.550
Your prophesy will have
proved false, Hinoto...

01:25:11.680 --> 01:25:15.740
and who wants a Dream Watcher
whose dreams don't come true?

01:25:16.290 --> 01:25:18.280
<i>Kanoe! No, you didn't!</i>

01:25:18.620 --> 01:25:22.220
Then, you'll be free, Hinoto...

01:25:22.360 --> 01:25:28.390
to win your freedom,
I'd do anything.

01:25:28.530 --> 01:25:31.360
Your freedom is all I ever wanted.

01:25:37.140 --> 01:25:39.300
<i>Kanoe.</i>

01:25:39.810 --> 01:25:40.430
Hah!

01:25:46.250 --> 01:25:47.580
Arashi!
Are you okay?

01:25:48.450 --> 01:25:49.080
Yes.

01:26:25.620 --> 01:26:29.420
Why... Why did you save me?

01:26:29.560 --> 01:26:32.320
I told you. You're my type.

01:26:33.260 --> 01:26:34.730
From the day I was born,

01:26:34.860 --> 01:26:38.390
I was destined to die fighting for
the Dragon of the Heavens.

01:26:39.570 --> 01:26:46.600
I thought, if I'm gonna die, I'll die
protecting a very pretty lady.

01:26:54.050 --> 01:27:00.280
I wish I could
protect you to the very end...

01:27:00.420 --> 01:27:03.550
but, babe, I can't
even see your pretty face...

01:27:04.390 --> 01:27:06.090
anymore.

01:27:07.360 --> 01:27:11.300
You know, I never
got around to asking you...

01:27:12.440 --> 01:27:15.430
how you feel about me...

01:27:18.340 --> 01:27:20.140
Sorata!

01:27:33.790 --> 01:27:36.120
Well, now you can ask her.

01:27:39.430 --> 01:27:40.400
<i>Kamui...</i>

01:27:41.400 --> 01:27:45.390
<i>all the members of the Dragon of
the Heavens are dead except you.</i>

01:27:46.340 --> 01:27:48.200
Fuma's killed them?

01:27:52.940 --> 01:27:56.540
<i>The Kamui of the Earth has no
memory of the past.</i>

01:27:56.680 --> 01:27:58.340
<i>He has no feeling.</i>

01:27:59.350 --> 01:28:03.080
<i>All he has is the urge to kill
the Dragon of the Heavens...</i>

01:28:03.220 --> 01:28:07.050
<i>and to destroy
Tokyo's power shields.</i>

01:28:30.380 --> 01:28:34.320
<i>I will send you to Tokyo Tower,
the final shield.</i>

01:28:34.820 --> 01:28:39.120
<i>Please choose
the end of your desire...</i>

01:28:40.560 --> 01:28:42.750
<i>Kanoe.</i>

01:29:20.900 --> 01:29:25.230
Fuma, don't you remember anything?

01:29:25.370 --> 01:29:26.860
Have you forgotten Kotori?

01:29:27.000 --> 01:29:28.090
Have you forgotten me?

01:29:28.540 --> 01:29:32.630
That girl loved Kamui
from the heart.

01:29:32.780 --> 01:29:37.140
Inside her, she grew a sword
which only Kamui could use.

01:29:38.410 --> 01:29:41.470
So I pulled it out.
It's as simple as that.

01:29:42.950 --> 01:29:44.250
Fuma.

01:30:10.450 --> 01:30:13.070
There is only one member of the
Dragon of the Heavens remaining...

01:30:13.220 --> 01:30:14.880
Your death will mark the ending.

01:30:15.720 --> 01:30:19.380
Fuma, I've come back
to protect you, not to...

01:30:20.790 --> 01:30:21.780
Hah!

01:30:32.740 --> 01:30:35.830
I didn't return to Tokyo
to fight you!

01:30:37.670 --> 01:30:41.200
I am Kamui.
Destiny has so decided.

01:30:43.380 --> 01:30:47.250
From the moment you chose to
become a Dragon of the Heavens...

01:30:47.380 --> 01:30:50.280
I was destined to become
a Dragon of the Earth.

01:30:51.020 --> 01:30:53.320
You're Fuma!
You're not me!

01:30:53.620 --> 01:30:55.150
I am Kamui!

01:31:01.630 --> 01:31:03.660
Man cannot fight his destiny!

01:31:09.910 --> 01:31:12.400
We were destined for this battle.

01:31:12.840 --> 01:31:15.470
And in the end,
mankind will be destroyed.

01:31:15.610 --> 01:31:17.170
That has also been preordained.

01:31:30.460 --> 01:31:31.450
No.

01:31:32.460 --> 01:31:34.830
We can choose our own destinies.

01:31:55.720 --> 01:31:59.210
Aaaaaaah!

01:32:01.620 --> 01:32:04.460
Fuma!

01:33:03.190 --> 01:33:07.250
Fuma.
You are Fuma, aren't you?

01:33:08.860 --> 01:33:09.650
<i>Yeah.</i>

01:33:10.160 --> 01:33:12.180
<i>You promised us...</i>

01:33:12.660 --> 01:33:16.390
<i>that you'd come back to protect Kotori.</i>

01:33:16.530 --> 01:33:19.130
<i>So I promised you that...</i>

01:33:20.340 --> 01:33:25.200
<i>if you protected Kotori,
I'd protect you.</i>

01:33:26.610 --> 01:33:31.510
- Hurry up, Kotori!
- Wait for me.

01:33:32.780 --> 01:33:34.610
Why?

01:33:34.750 --> 01:33:38.520
Why did this have to happen?
Tell me!

01:33:44.630 --> 01:33:48.430
Fuma!
